</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Constructs a new <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/atomic/atomic_flag\">std::atomic_flag</a></span>. \n</p>\n<table class=\"t-rev-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-until-cxx20\"><td>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Trivial default constructor, initializes <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/atomic/atomic_flag\">std::atomic_flag</a></span> to unspecified state.\n</div></td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx20\">(until C++20)</span></td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-since-cxx20\"><td>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Initializes <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/atomic/atomic_flag\">std::atomic_flag</a></span> to clear state.\n</div></td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span></td></tr>\n</table>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> The copy constructor is deleted; <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/atomic/atomic_flag\">std::atomic_flag</a></span> is not copyable.</div>\n<p>In addition, <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/atomic/atomic_flag\">std::atomic_flag</a></span> can be value-initialized to clear state with the expression <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/atomic/ATOMIC_FLAG_INIT\">ATOMIC_FLAG_INIT</a></span>. For an <code>atomic_flag</code> with static <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/storage_duration#Storage_duration\">storage duration</a>, this guarantees <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/initialization#Static_initialization\">static initialization</a>: the flag can be used in constructors of static objects.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/atomic/ATOMIC_FLAG_INIT\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>ATOMIC_FLAG_INIT</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n